509	/*
510	 * Flex (not grid) so the bounded trailing region cannot starve the subject.
511	 * The sender column is sized from the list width, so it stays aligned on
512	 * every row and gives up width first as the pane narrows: 132px from a
513	 * ~700px list, ~115px at the 1030px window, 96px at its floor. Only if a row
514	 * still cannot fit its subject/snippet floor does that row's sender shrink
515	 * further (to 72px); the metadata keeps its full content.
516	 */
